<description>&lt;p&gt;The Cameroonian government has expanded its BIR rapid-intervention force around Lake Chad, deploying drones and joint border patrols to target Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest. Government troops killed four suspected separatists after a village attack, while a landmine near the border killed eight soldiers and police were wounded in separate attacks in Fundong. Issa Tchiroma’s party was suspended for three months, and Cameroon received a Metal Shark patrol boat to bolster maritime security. President Paul Biya returned to Cameroon, as noted by Genocide Watch. The UCDP recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOeThURzFhOXoxNFB2R3ZUd3pxbHl6M29oOHNsY0tTZ3dqZk16Um00UVdScTB4RDNyVVU4cTBvS2tpVUl3b21YQlMtRklXWlhuczRyaWZTOEhWLTNpb015emsxa2xZV1N0M2l1bWMweUIwc2JMMFhCVk5oaDcwcWVzSHd0MGkyaFE4QUFiMHE1X0dfdEI3Mm4tc09JQ01mT3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGT1RjejE5QkpYMlJkRm01ZWVLeWlBbnNtdGVBRUFVSHM1NXdPSnBPaDBfOWdqdklIVnZyNTBsOHR0YzZZZHlJcEhPcy05a1N6UFJfcHM4b29zbndoM0HSAWNBVV95cUxPc3BzWlV6ZXZyZkNSbzAwSzRGTmtiNkRsUEtKVWhxNXhkaUZkRThMa2owUVU4eGVOMnNqamY1TFBaTWNCSUYxTzF0ZG1Tb1I2bFNOb01DMTByczVoMG13MFdhUDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1zRi14TlJJQ1VsVDdGemlzV2poSjBwbkR2VFI3T1N6bmE1b3FXazVveGtCQmFwSGxzZlZDMnNkc0xrYVFGUExqX0hwaVpmV0M2NXYtcU5YdV9JcVM1?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPWm55ZXFoN2Fmek0zZ25jZzJsbHA3M2NjRkdSZ0dtOHIydlhnN1RDSExZRHd6WTBvdWJtZUo2ZDVRdkhlaUR3MG9vbUhSdk5Iekk5QXdHNjlmQVRYNmVSajFZQlJQZkR2UDhQRzhEVW5vS2ZTdWxCeUp2VUdMN2pGZ0dz